OL,3,ARepublican congressman to force
OL,4,Aimpeachment vote on Defence Secretary
OL,5,AHegseth
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Republican congressman plans to force
OL,8,Fa vote in the House of Representatives
OL,9,Fthis week to impeach Defence Secretary
OL,10,FPete Hegseth, alleging he has violated
OL,11,Fthe US Constitution.
OL,13,F"By engaging in hostilities in Iran for
OL,14,Fmore than 90 days without congressional
OL,15,Fauthorisation, Secretary Hegseth is
OL,16,Fbreaking the law and must be held
OL,17,Faccountable," Representative Thomas
OL,18,FMassie said.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
