OL,3,ARepublican congressman to force
OL,4,Aimpeachment vote on Defence Secretary
OL,5,AHegseth
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe effort will likely fail, as
OL,8,FRepublicans remain in power in Congress
OL,9,Funtil January. But Massie says the
OL,10,Feffort is aimed at pushing President
OL,11,FDonald Trump to replace Hegseth before
OL,12,FDemocrats can launch their own
OL,13,Fimpeachment process.
OL,15,FHegseth has called the impeachment
OL,16,Feffort a "sham" and defended his
OL,17,Frecord.
